Use Vivado's Performance_Explore strategy for the Pluto implementation

The 40-clock elastic reference delay met timing with Performance_Explore
(+0.080 ns routed setup WNS). The default strategy missed setup timing on
ADI control paths. Record the strategy in the source project Tcl so a clean
factory build uses the verified implementation settings.
diff --git a/hdl/projects/pluto/system_project.tcl b/hdl/projects/pluto/system_project.tcl
--- a/hdl/projects/pluto/system_project.tcl
+++ b/hdl/projects/pluto/system_project.tcl
@@ -9,5 +9,6 @@ adi_project_files pluto [list \
   "$ad_hdl_dir/library/common/ad_iobuf.v"]
 
 set_property is_enabled false [get_files  *system_sys_ps7_0.xdc]
+set_property strategy Performance_Explore [get_runs impl_1]
 adi_project_run pluto
 source $ad_hdl_dir/library/axi_ad9361/axi_ad9361_delay.tcl
